    "Utopia\\SMTP\\Transport\\Swoole::*": "PHP runtime plumbing: the Swoole coroutine transport, PHP's second I/O model. Rust has one async transport (TcpTransport), whose behaviour the transport.* cases hold to the same promises (cases/SwooleTest.json ports SwooleTest onto it)."
